{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7d39c018b8ad5a990fcfad4612a7ac13b1e6399b3caab2d3400b93b6af10a374", "ja": "フィナーレライブ、開演！", "zh": "压轴演出，开演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "13a433b9da238417c86266540bdee39b9b82fd485537db3956a585eee47e30ef", "ja": "感謝祭のフィナーレはアイドル達による\nライブ。その裏側で感無量の亜利沙や春香。\n『天体公演』と『STARDOM ROAD』、演目\nは違えどそれぞれが互いに支えられていたと\n確かめ合い、ライブはクライマックスへ。", "zh": "感恩祭的压轴是偶像们带来的\n演唱会。在后台，亚利沙和春香也感慨万千。\n虽然《天体公演》和《STARDOM ROAD》的演出\n各不相同，但她们确认了彼此一直在相互支持，\n演唱会也迎来了高潮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c803e997d076c58900b432f98a981d24309899db51af64143fb42e1c97c21fa", "ja": "（感謝祭の最後を飾るのは、もちろんライブ！\n『STARDOM ROAD』の楽曲から始まり……）", "zh": "（为感恩祭画上句号的，当然是演唱会！从《STARDOM ROAD》的歌曲开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bf7ea4a451c9c8e281bf40455d4149c8c7cad2eaf46a1e04f4a905a3781855d1", "ja": "（最後に『ソル』『ルナ』『ステラ』が連続して\n曲披露をしたことで、ボルテージも最高潮だ！）", "zh": "（最后『Sol』『Luna』『Stella』接连登台演出，现场气氛也达到了最高潮！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "118e4477f545b7fb172fb8ac7269b252b08af36566f1aa4c7a54edb486d448c3", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさまー！\nどうだったかな？　私達のステージ？", "zh": "大家辛苦啦——！\n感觉怎么样？我们的舞台还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab017e14d38fa43219c00bea535c6ccb7ba9defab512979e5f30585ebf5a61e9", "ja": "もちろんっ！！！\n最高以外の言葉がありませんっ！！！", "zh": "当然了！！！\n除了“最棒”之外，已经没有别的词可以形容了！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "15feb42fe45b5ef4f407a1f64b7b19133b8d3ed08860d540f65bbb7b1fcdbf70", "ja": "とってもかっこよかったよ！\nとちゅうで息ができなかったくらい！", "zh": "特别帅气哦！\n甚至中途都喘不过气来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "b2f682d6c767f6f7a09c04f45fff52185e2f3f7abb544f8dadf33e46a59a4bbb", "ja": "よかった～♪　じゃあ『STARDOM ROAD』からの\n盛り上がり、ちゃんと引き継げたのかなぁ……。", "zh": "太好了～♪　这么说来，\n大家的热情有好好从《STARDOM ROAD》延续下来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "a98a481d0bd98258f3f5d8ca14407ff34cf77406bdcf5256c65ab3e3fdae26bf", "ja": "あ、そういえばこの感覚、\n天体公演ツアーの時とおんなじかも。", "zh": "啊，说起来，这种感觉，\n或许和天体公演巡演时一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "4a2d30e1c82b338935924ce2932a32037544b6f78e85dc70b9b2da1f29a0d2b2", "ja": "みんなのことを応援する気持ちと……\nふふっ。いいなぁって、憧れる気持ち。", "zh": "支持大家的心情……\n还有，呵呵。觉得“真好啊”，向往着的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "64cb60fe5c6046980c05989edd79a2b9446dca174b1a799b83432cc5ed8c296d", "ja": "えっ？　憧れる……？", "zh": "咦？憧憬……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "45aed62ddd2962da3162bb9b190867104ceb99aad26aa6b244e394f6d4a7db09", "ja": "うん！　連続もののお芝居で、超ロングラン公演\nなんてプレッシャーもすごいはずなのに……。", "zh": "嗯！明明是连续剧般的戏剧，还要进行超长期公演，压力肯定也很大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "a9b89603f7e2ce782d8ca23497969c86bf7802233db0fe85fdcd4105bd8f31ab", "ja": "みんなまっすぐに走り抜けていって……\nとっても、キラキラしてて。眩しかったの。", "zh": "大家笔直地一路奔跑过去……\n真的闪闪发光，耀眼夺目呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "671085672d33723cf006567e0e869c98bafb0e2ff2ab04977db869bf301b829c", "ja": "それなら……私達は春香ちゃん達の天体公演から\n勇気をたくさんもらったわ。", "zh": "这样的话……我们从春香她们的天体公演中得到了许多勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "4eea085ace6fdcf3b8b1b5831128a6408ea7840efcda604251c22051e7823f6b", "ja": "勇気、ですか？", "zh": "勇气……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "6515f8c16fb9508d7fd53d08d22f0cab0b19a6277c644323f3b4e39a15014c5a", "ja": "ええ。私達が物語を繋ぐのに頑張っている時に、\n春香ちゃん達は、天体公演をしっかり繋いでくれて。", "zh": "是的。在我们努力将故事串联起来的时候，春香她们也努力将天体公演紧紧连接在了一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "98be04d385aae136c9894af61fcfc4e542cc1cad74d16c6614a78640b2b8a0c1", "ja": "ちゃんと繋がっていけるんだって、勇気をもらえて……\n不思議とみんな気合いが入っていたわ。", "zh": "相信我们一定能一直相连下去……不知为何，大家都干劲十足呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "8c1d81f6ea8f48e68379f50cb39f01e8c64effcdc326d78fcfe703c277324321", "ja": "もしかしたら私達、お互い感じあっていたのかもね。\n離れていても、同じ星を見上げているみたいに。", "zh": "或许我们彼此之间，也是能相互感受到的吧。\n就如同即使身在异处，仰望的也是同一颗星一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "76aaf711ad735618c312d7d58d4da28433a3dceffb829ab6622df0338ac47c6b", "ja": "ありさもお芝居の稽古を頑張りつつ、\n天体公演は全通しましたから！", "zh": "亚利沙也一边努力排练，一边把天体公演全场都看完了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "ad197931ed42aee23ca67187fa51a0d415016a27d9be1fa435ef26c8af054529", "ja": "わたしも春香さん達の曲、毎日きいてたの。\n歌詞も全部おぼえたんだよ！", "zh": "我也每天都在听春香姐姐她们的歌哦。\n连歌词都全部记住了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "5c99d0bab540af21c024620be6d7e598a6727cbd7d3d5a701bbe3eb386d0a2b9", "ja": "天体公演の日は、遅くまで感想を送り合って。\nみんな夜更かしだったね。", "zh": "天体公演那天，我们一直聊到很晚，互相发送感想。大家都熬夜了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "86e45a6f1dfbdd27bb0e20c7766178fb597d115694f0abef3e08dc22a31f2f6d", "ja": "そうなんだ……。それじゃ、私たち本当の星みたいに、\nちゃんとお互いを照らし合えていたのかな……♪", "zh": "原来是这样……那么，我们是不是也像真正的星星一样，\n切实地彼此照亮了呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6e05966605c0f4302ab060e6e178980de601519938b11ff5d2bd8515cabe8fde", "ja": "もちろん。そして、二つの星を見上げて、星明りに\n照らされていたのは、客席のファンも一緒だ。", "zh": "当然。而且，仰望着那两颗星、被星光\n照耀着的，台下的粉丝们也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "03adbbe95b1a10e7358b99201139fe7f20001aeda28cf8c72f292aabd405020c", "ja": "そうね！　それじゃ、{$P$}。\nそんな二つの星が重なり合った輝きを……", "zh": "对呀！那么，{$P$}先生。就让这两颗星辰交相辉映的光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_05_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "201b6769447d33a7e91553c159b39736b7c2229d0ee7984c8e47b22c60043e2e", "ja": "私達の、とびっきりの輝きを！\n最後のフィナーレで、思いっきり届けてくるわね！", "zh": "把我们无与伦比的耀眼光芒！在最后的压轴演出中，尽情传达给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
